steps.message:
I’ll refine the controller before expanding tests:
- enable `draggable` only while cards are inside a desktop board controller, avoiding inert drag behavior elsewhere;
- fix insertion after an all-golden prefix;
- capture the card explicitly for asynchronous requests;
- roll back to its original DOM position on a failed save, without allowing an older failed request to undo a newer drag;
- ignore unrelated external drops.

These changes preserve the immediate success path while making edge behavior safe.

