steps.message:
I’ll make the regression test stronger and more observable:
- use an ordinary card dropped into a column whose first card is golden, exercising canonical grouping;
- split drag events so the dim and hover classes are asserted;
- record destination order while the save is blocked;
- after releasing the save, wait for server-rendered card metadata to arrive via morph and assert the order is unchanged.

This directly verifies both “instant” and “nothing shifting afterwards.”

